OL,3,ANorth Korea denies being behind record
OL,4,A$6.3bn Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Korea has denied claims that it
OL,7,Fwas behind the record $6.3bn (#4.7bn)
OL,8,Fhack of cryptocurrency exchange
OL,9,FBinance, calling the allegations an
OL,10,F"absurd rhetoric".
OL,12,FKim Yo-jong, one of the Democratic
OL,13,FPeople's Republic of Korea's top
OL,14,Fofficials and the sister of leader Kim
OL,15,FJong Un, said in a statement on Tuesday
OL,16,Fthat the accusations are another
OL,17,F"sinister attempt" by the US to damage
OL,18,Fthe country's public image.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
